================================================================
3. THE STORY ITSELF
================================================================

The events, characters, and structure of the Odyssey are in the public
domain and have been for a very long time. Nothing in this repository
claims any right over them.

The prose in canon/ was written for this project. It is not adapted
from, derived from, or based on any translation of Homer. It was
written with assistance from Claude, an AI assistant made by Anthropic.

Nothing here restricts anyone else from writing their own Odyssey, in
any form, by any means. Neither could it.
